@startuml
actor Utilisateur
participant "Flask app" as Flask
participant "vmware_api" as API
participant "SQLite" as DB
participant "vCenter" as VC

Utilisateur -> Flask: POST /vmware/snapshot
Flask -> API: create_snapshot(vm_name, snapshot_name, session_id)
API -> DB: acquire_vm_lock()
DB --> API: verrou acquis
API -> VC: CreateSnapshot_Task()
VC --> API: etat de la tache
API -> DB: release_vm_lock()
API --> Flask: resultat JSON
Flask --> Utilisateur: 200 OK / 4xx

@enduml
